00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:14.290
they've loved to have on set it's a
great way again just to show your

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:18.640
appreciation hey I remember that you
really like dried mango here's some

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:23.380
dried mango for you I am a hot tea
drinker not a coffee drinker so I love

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:27.130
when sets have a hot water kettle and
some tea bags

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:31.210
that's what how I keep my energy up so
ask that too you know does everybody

00:15:31.210 --> 00:15:35.920
here drink coffee or do we need to have
a tea kettle on set is a huge help from

00:15:35.920 --> 00:15:41.650
